OL,3,GNEWSATeen given life sentence for
OL,4,Amurdering man in alley
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been handed a life
OL,7,Fsentence with a minimum term of 16
OL,8,Fyears after stabbing a 46-year-old man
OL,9,Fto death in an alleyway robbery.
OL,11,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,12,Fdue to his age, was sentenced at
OL,13,FBristol Crown Court on Tuesday after
OL,14,Fbeing found guilty of murdering drug
OL,15,Fdealer Hamid Erfani in Cheltenham on 16
OL,16,FDecember 2025.
OL,18,FThe boy, along with an 18-year-old who
OL,19,Fthe BBC is not naming, robbed Erfani of
OL,20,Fcash, drugs and a mobile phone - which
OL,21,Fthe pair previously admitted to - as
OL,22,Fwell as being in possession of knives.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
