OL,3,GNEWSATeen given life sentence for
OL,4,Amurdering man in alley
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the 18-year-old was
OL,7,Fsentenced to a three-year youth
OL,8,Frehabilitation order for robbery and
OL,9,Fknife possession, with a supervision
OL,10,Fperiod of three years.
